---
globs: src/app/**/*.tsx, src/components/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

- Reuse existing components in {{src/components/ui/}} before creating new ones. Search first.
- Named exports only. One component per file, under ~200 lines; split if it grows.
- Style with {{Tailwind}} classes only. No inline style objects, no new CSS files.
- Every async UI state needs loading, empty, and error states.
- Every form input has a label. Buttons and links must be usable by keyboard.
- Don't fetch data in client components if a server component or existing hook can do it.
